"""J.A.R.V.I.S. Render Bridge Edition v2.5.3

A local Flask assistant designed for Pydroid 3 on Android.
- Chat: OpenRouter, Ollama or Gemini with image analysis and web search
- TTS: Edge TTS -> Azure Speech -> Gemini TTS -> browser/device voice
- Persona-specific voice profiles for J.A.R.V.I.S., F.R.I.D.A.Y. and E.D.I.T.H.
- Offline local utilities with searchable tool metadata.

Gateway provider keys are saved locally in a plaintext config file with best-effort restrictive file permissions; browser settings may also be stored in localStorage. Saved keys are not encrypted.
"""
